{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't Freeze: A Winter Card Survival Demo is a limited version of the full game. It features the core gameplay of the full version, limited to the first two locations. Wishlist the full version to play the complete Card Open World Survival Simulator game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded in the aftermath of a passenger jet crash, you are the sole survivor in a merciless winter wilderness. Your mission: stay alive long enough to make it back to civilization \u2014 all while navigating this deadly environment in a unique card-based survival experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through over 10 diverse environments, from the wreckage of the crash site to frigid rivers, abandoned towns, and vast, unrelenting winter terrain that will test every ounce of your survival instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/27d436aa975d288fee05b84572696814.poster.avif?t=1752409656\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/27d436aa975d288fee05b84572696814.webm?t=1752409656\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/27d436aa975d288fee05b84572696814.mp4?t=1752409656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt, fish, trap, and scavenge to find vital food and supplies \u2014 anything you can use to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/a2936ecd33d3af0f320c327daf3032d0.poster.avif?t=1752409656\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/a2936ecd33d3af0f320c327daf3032d0.webm?t=1752409656\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/a2936ecd33d3af0f320c327daf3032d0.mp4?t=1752409656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft campfires and wear the right gear to shield yourself from the biting cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/4e892f88f474035fec5c468bfc0e8527.poster.avif?t=1752409656\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/4e892f88f474035fec5c468bfc0e8527.webm?t=1752409656\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/4e892f88f474035fec5c468bfc0e8527.mp4?t=1752409656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your Hunger, Thirst, Fatigue, and Cold, constantly balancing your resources and energy to stay alive. Every decision you make can be the difference between survival and death. When you die, your save file is wiped \u2014 no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/62906de1d388ee67b978fbd2582d8a34.poster.avif?t=1752409656\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/62906de1d388ee67b978fbd2582d8a34.webm?t=1752409656\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853360/extras/62906de1d388ee67b978fbd2582d8a34.mp4?t=1752409656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>